sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant O as Provider Owner
 participant UI as Provider UI
 participant API as FastAPI
 participant PG as PostgreSQL
 participant SCH as Scheduler/Worker
 participant PDF as WeasyPrint Worker
 participant SMTP as Mailpit/Postal
 participant WA as WhatsApp API
 O->>UI: Confirm payment
 UI->>API: POST invoice/payments; idempotency key
 API->>PG: Transaction: validate role+balance, append Payment
 API->>PG: Update invoice status, outbox event, commit
 API-->>UI: 201 payment confirmed
 SCH->>PG: Fetch committed payment event
 SCH->>PDF: Generate immutable receipt from snapshot
 PDF->>PG: Persist private object key and checksum
 SCH->>SMTP: Send recipient email (SMTP)
 SMTP-->>SCH: accepted by relay or error
 opt subscriber explicitly opted into WhatsApp
  SCH->>WA: Send approved template + secure receipt link
  WA-->>SCH: provider message ID/status
 end
 SCH->>PG: Record delivery attempt/status (not false delivered)
